{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36653","headline":"商於驿楼东望有感 · 罗隐","name":"商於驿楼东望有感","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山川去接汉江东，曾伴隋侯醉此中。\n歌绕夜梁珠宛转，舞娇春席雪朦胧。\n棠遗善政阴犹在，薤送哀声事已空。\n惆怅知音竟难得，两行清泪白杨风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}